<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">In celebration of Hispanic Heritage month, Mayor Andrew J. Ginther invites you to join a virtual roundtable focused on equity in the Hispanic/Latinx community.</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>DATE</strong><br>Thursday, September 23, 2021<br>2:00 p.m. to 3:00 p.m.</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>MEETING INFO</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><a href="https://cocmeetings.webex.com/cocmeetings/onstage/g.php?MTID=e285940eca9884aa6c76ee89e9efd3a65&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">https://cocmeetings.webex.com/cocmeetings/onstage/g.php?MTID=e285940eca9884aa6c76ee89e9efd3a65</a></p>
